  message: "Merged in PRs #2356 (Rust + JS) and #2357 (Go + C + Java). All 6 language catalogs (Python, Rust, JavaScript/TypeScript, Go, C, Java) cover 6+ boundary types each. FFI integration deferred — existing FFI linkers already create cross-language edges; the boundary map naturally traverses them."  # ec9e
- op: discuss  # 09f5
  at: '2026-03-19T00:45:21Z'  # 09f5
  by: human  # 09f5
