  message: "Acknowledged. Keeping open as P4 for explicit FFI integration. The common case works today (FFI linkers create cross-language edges → boundary tagging finds primitives on both sides). Explicit integration would improve edge cases where intermediate C/FFI functions wrap I/O primitives without being directly annotated."  # d40b
